    "page_title": "API Reference",
    "short_description": "The Godzilla REST API: pipelines (v3), events (v3), connectors, transforms, webhooks, rate limits, and error reference.",
    "body": "{{ds:component/hero|title=API Reference|subtitle=Every endpoint in the Godzilla REST API, with request/response examples.|cta_html=<a href="{{cms:item/65a5f692-bb10-4ad1-889a-28a19b3f4610}}">Start with Pipelines</a>}}

<section>
  <p>All endpoints require a bearer <a href="{{cms:item/d4b550f6-6175-4b1a-858c-5a206d22adce}}">API key</a>. The pipelines and events endpoints are on v3 (<code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>), while all other endpoints currently live under <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v2</code>. New to the API? Read <a href="{{cms:item/d4b550f6-6175-4b1a-858c-5a206d22adce}}">Authentication</a> in Getting Started first.</p>

  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/65a5f692-bb10-4ad1-889a-28a19b3f4610}}|tag=Endpoint (v3)|title=Pipelines|description=Create, list, and manage pipelines via the v3 API.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/52eb7a61-4b8b-49e6-8ff3-e96c2d994705}}|tag=Endpoint (v2)|title=Pipelines (v2)|description=Previous v2 version of the pipelines endpoint.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/12565c25-b278-43dc-aba1-31def311efa4}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Connectors|description=Create, list, and rotate credentials for connectors.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/cc2e9b39-d44c-42c9-ad82-8ed72200e699}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Transforms|description=Create and list transform steps for a pipeline.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/1dfea1b3-6ab8-4e22-bbcb-3628c9f31c7a}}|tag=Endpoint (v3)|title=Events|description=Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline via the v3 API.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/6e2fe20d-5b70-4f5b-9216-71f1d0b736b1}}|tag=Endpoint|title=Webhooks|description=Subscribe to platform lifecycle events over outbound HTTP.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/6ff7090a-d1a9-4f90-91ae-6c8e3bd5942f}}|tag=Reference|title=Rate limits|description=Standard-tier limits, rate limit headers, and cursor pagination envelope.}}
  {{ds:component/card|href={{cms:item/4fcc4b70-40ef-4a45-8644-81369d60758e}}|tag=Reference|title=Error reference|description=The v2 API's error response shape and error handling.}}
